@startuml
title Inclusion Routine Completion Flow

actor Holder
participant "Assistant GUI" as GUI
participant "AI Assistant" as AI
participant "Identity Module" as ID
participant "Tokenomics" as TOK

Holder -> GUI: Select IR
GUI -> Holder: Guide capture (local only)
GUI -> AI: Send hashed proof + metadata
AI -> AI: Verify IR locally
AI -> ID: MsgSubmitIRProof
ID -> AI: Validate signature / prereqs
ID -> ID: Update ConfidenceScore
ID -> TOK: Trigger PoI reward emission
TOK -> AI: Send assistant reward
ID --> Holder: Emit event (CS updated)

@enduml
